\p{As a pre-cursor, I highly recommend reading the original [FlexAttention paper](dongFlexAttentionProgramming2024). Additionally, a big shout out to the people at google for [SplashAttention](splash_attention)\sidenote{For a very deep dive on splash attention, I \strong{highly} recommend [this blog](toulme2026xla).}, which we unfortunately aim to make obsolete as a subset of flex attention. We will cover the key implementation details to accentuate our work here.}

